Package: flippies-desktop
Version: 1.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Create Flippies <flippies@deb.flip>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: jwm, mawk | awk
Description: Start menu of installed apps for the Create Flippies desktop
 flippies-apps-menu makes the "Apps" submenu of the desktop's Start menu (a JWM
 dynamic menu) from the installed programs' .desktop files, grouped into a few
 folders by category, so programs installed with apt appear in the menu on their
 own. A dpkg trigger keeps a cached copy current. Programs that come without a
 menu entry (xcalc and the other x11-apps, Lua) get one. Installed on a disk
 made before it, it adds the Apps submenu to each user's ~/.jwmrc.
